# Language: English Only

All Cursor rules, agent instructions, and AI-generated project artifacts must be written in **English**.

## Scope

- `.cursor/rules/*.mdc` files
- `AGENTS.md` and other agent instruction files
- Code comments, docstrings, and `MarkdownDescription` fields added by the AI
- Commit messages, PR descriptions, and CHANGELOG entries drafted by the AI
- Generated or updated documentation in `docs/` and `examples/`

## Exceptions

- User-facing Terraform attribute descriptions may stay in the language required by product or localization needs, but default to English unless the user specifies otherwise.
- Do not translate existing French or other non-English user messages; respond to the user in their preferred language while keeping project artifacts in English.

## When creating new rules

- Write rule titles, descriptions, and body content in English.
- Use `description` frontmatter in English (shown in the Cursor rule picker).
